# Profile Application — Walkthrough

## What Was Built
A React.js single-page profile/portfolio for **Harsha Vardhan Dasam** with a premium dark + light blue theme.

## Tech Stack
- **Vite + React** (scaffolded via `create-vite`)
- **Vanilla CSS** with Inter font, custom design tokens
- Node.js LTS installed via `winget` (was missing)

## Components Created

| Component | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| [Header.jsx](file:///c:/Users/harsh/OneDrive/Documents/Vibe_coding_NHCE/src/components/Header.jsx) | Hero with avatar, name, tagline, contact |
| [Summary.jsx](file:///c:/Users/harsh/OneDrive/Documents/Vibe_coding_NHCE/src/components/Summary.jsx) | Professional summary |
| [Skills.jsx](file:///c:/Users/harsh/OneDrive/Documents/Vibe_coding_NHCE/src/components/Skills.jsx) | 4-category skill cards |
| [Experience.jsx](file:///c:/Users/harsh/OneDrive/Documents/Vibe_coding_NHCE/src/components/Experience.jsx) | Internship details |
| [Projects.jsx](file:///c:/Users/harsh/OneDrive/Documents/Vibe_coding_NHCE/src/components/Projects.jsx) | 3 project cards |
| [Education.jsx](file:///c:/Users/harsh/OneDrive/Documents/Vibe_coding_NHCE/src/components/Education.jsx) | Timeline education |
| [Achievements.jsx](file:///c:/Users/harsh/OneDrive/Documents/Vibe_coding_NHCE/src/components/Achievements.jsx) | Achievement highlight |
| [Interests.jsx](file:///c:/Users/harsh/OneDrive/Documents/Vibe_coding_NHCE/src/components/Interests.jsx) | Emoji interest chips |
| [Footer.jsx](file:///c:/Users/harsh/OneDrive/Documents/Vibe_coding_NHCE/src/components/Footer.jsx) | Links + copyright |

## Design Features
- 🎨 **Light blue + black theme** with CSS custom properties
- ✨ **Glowing card shadows** and hover lift effects
- 🎭 **Fade-in animations** on scroll
- 📱 **Fully responsive** (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- 🔵 **Initials avatar** with blue glow (falls back gracefully)

