## How to Run
```bash
cd c:\Users\harsh\OneDrive\Documents\Vibe_coding_NHCE
npm run dev
# Opens at http://localhost:5173
```

> [!TIP]
> To add your real photo, place a `profile.jpg` file in the `public/` folder. The app will automatically use it instead of the initials avatar.
